==Description==
The '''Lightning Nametag''' is a {{Color|Legendary}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''Lightning Nametag''' has yellow text and a black outline, which are surrounded by crackling yellow pixelated lightning. Occasionally, it also emits a square yellow particle.

